  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "筆譯理論與實務",
    "sub_ename": "TRANSLATION THEORY AND  PRACTICE",
    "describe_ch": "本研討課程?容涵蓋時下翻譯學的理論、方法以及實踐等各方面。從語言、文化以及文學等面向取材，本課程還會介紹翻譯的歷史發展、倫理道德的爭議以及翻譯在傳播人類知識與文明上所發揮的作用。授課形式多元化，包含了三個工作坊以及一場業師的分享會，還有課上的學生親手實做活動。學習完本課程的研究生必定能夠對翻譯以及翻譯學的理論與實務都有清楚而全面的認識。",
    "describe_eh": "This graduate seminar in translation studies provides an in-depth exploration of the theories, methodologies, and practices that comprise the field of translation studies. Drawing on a diverse range of linguistic, cultural, and literary perspectives, the course examines the historical development of translation, its ethical considerations, and the role of translation in the production and dissemination of knowledge across languages and cultures. Moreover, this seminar will feature diverse instruction modes with three workshops and one guest lecture, plus one student hands-on practice session. By the end of the seminar, students will have developed a sophisticated understanding of the theoretical underpinnings of translation.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "提供研究生提升自己的機會。",
      "describe_en": "This seminar can serve as a follow-up to a basic translation college course. Ideal for students endeavoring to enter the translation/interpreting industry."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "强化基礎知識，提升學生學習動機，並進而鼓勵反思。",
      "describe_en": "Translation requires some background in linguistics; at the same time, it will serve as a good start for interpreting."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "鼓勵學生能從不同角度切入思量翻譯如何導入科技，翻譯又如何促進人類的文明。",
      "describe_en": "As this will be a seminar, students will be given workshops on these three themes: film translation, literary translation and machine translation and AI. On top of that, every effort will be made for a guest lecture on the translation industry."
    }
  ],
